# Double strike (CR 702.4b): it deals combat damage twice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Shrike Force
Plains x22

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Shrike Force.Cast
Bot1.Pass
